#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/example/farthest-point-sampling.md:1
#: 371f30ab14a7466f8716abd1f530309a
msgid "最远点采样：从候选池挑代表结构"
msgstr "Farthest-Point Sampling: Select Representative Structures"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/example/farthest-point-sampling.md:3
#: 748953f7d364417883892275f00900a1
msgid ""
"最远点采样（FPS）适合从大量相似候选结构中挑出一个更有代表性的子集。它只判断描"
"述符距离，不判断结构是否合理；如果候选池里有原子重叠等坏结构，应先清洗，再做 "
"FPS。"
msgstr ""
"Farthest-point sampling (FPS) selects a representative subset from a large "
"pool of similar candidate structures. It only considers descriptor distance, "
"not whether a structure is physically reasonable. Clean structures with "
"overlapping atoms or other defects before running FPS."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/example/farthest-point-sampling.md:5
#: 7aa3dd89e1cf46ab8ff66195c733cd13
msgid "1. 打开描述符图"
msgstr "1. Open the descriptor plot"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/example/farthest-point-sampling.md:7
#: 455f0b68bf0440a8af1fda6e29aa9601
msgid ""
"在 `NEP Dataset Display` 中打开清洗后的候选结构和可用于计算描述符的 "
"`nep.txt`。双击 `descriptor` 小图，把它切换到主图区，然后点击 `Sparse "
"samples`。"
msgstr ""
"In `NEP Dataset Display`, open the cleaned candidate structures and a "
"`nep.txt` that can calculate their descriptors. Double-click the "
"`descriptor` thumbnail to move it into the main plot, then click `Sparse "
"samples`."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/example/farthest-point-sampling.md:9
#: 38edfc70c17b4d50bea343cb09b27991
msgid "描述符图和最远点采样入口"
msgstr "Descriptor plot and the farthest-point sampling action"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/example/farthest-point-sampling.md:9
#: 38edfc70c17b4d50bea343cb09b27991
msgid ".. image:: ../_static/image/generated/tutorials/fps_sampling_entry.png"
msgstr ".. image:: ../_static/image/generated/tutorials/fps_sampling_entry.png"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/example/farthest-point-sampling.md:14
#: dee77c191f27496f9688ce20f623302d
msgid "2. 第一次这样设置"
msgstr "2. Use these settings for your first run"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/example/farthest-point-sampling.md:16
#: 88ad34370da448a1b7d40ec153a87e89
msgid "下面的示例从 25 个同类结构中挑 8 个："
msgstr ""
"The following example selects 8 structures from a pool of 25 similar "
"candidates:"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/example/farthest-point-sampling.md:18
#: 9d907e2f0a1a4957ae486154a13bc7a6
msgid "最远点采样设置窗口"
msgstr "Farthest-point sampling settings"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/example/farthest-point-sampling.md:18
#: 9d907e2f0a1a4957ae486154a13bc7a6
msgid ""
".. image:: ../_static/image/generated/show_nep_reference/g_sparse_dialog.png"
msgstr ""
".. image:: ../_static/image/generated/show_nep_reference/g_sparse_dialog.png"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/example/farthest-point-sampling.md:23
#: d250a284e9434fefa8633abda0e79282
msgid "`Selection strategy` 选择 `Global FPS`。它适合同一元素集合的候选池。"
msgstr ""
"Set `Selection strategy` to `Global FPS`. This is suitable when all "
"candidates have the same element set."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/example/farthest-point-sampling.md:24
#: c28e38ee7907431586d275ff211ef8dd
msgid ""
"`Sampling mode` 选择 `Fixed count (FPS)`，`Sample limit` 填计划保留的结构数，"
"例如 `8`。"
msgstr ""
"Set `Sampling mode` to `Fixed count (FPS)`, then enter the number of "
"structures to retain in `Sample limit`, such as `8`."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/example/farthest-point-sampling.md:25
#: 3f230fb1eff9403d81021d219054d2ff
msgid ""
"`Min distance` 先用当前默认值 `0.01`。描述符尺度取决于模型；如果最终不足 8 "
"个，说明距离条件过严，应调小后重试。"
msgstr ""
"Start with the current `Min distance` default of `0.01`. Descriptor scales "
"depend on the model. If fewer than 8 structures are selected, the distance "
"threshold is too strict; reduce it and try again."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/example/farthest-point-sampling.md:26
#: c4f0024136254239b8bfc68da8704db5
msgid "`Descriptor source` 选择 `Reduced (PCA)`，其余高级选项先留空。"
msgstr ""
"Set `Descriptor source` to `Reduced (PCA)` and leave the other advanced "
"options empty for now."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/example/farthest-point-sampling.md:27
#: 5c851b1127dd4217adc73e97885ebdfc
msgid "点击 `OK`。"
msgstr "Click `OK`."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/example/farthest-point-sampling.md:29
#: 94629cd203ad442fb2e81c1019318b2d
msgid ""
"如果候选池混合了不同元素集合，改用 `Element-set balanced FPS`。它会先给每个元"
"素集合分配名额，因此 `Sample limit` 不能小于元素集合数量。`Training dataset` "
"只在希望避开已有训练集覆盖区域时填写；第一次从单一候选池采样可以留空。"
msgstr ""
"If the candidate pool contains different element sets, use `Element-set "
"balanced FPS`. It allocates a quota to each element set, so `Sample limit` "
"must not be smaller than the number of element sets. Fill in `Training "
"dataset` only when you want to avoid regions already covered by an existing "
"training set. Leave it empty for a first pass over a single candidate pool."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/example/farthest-point-sampling.md:31
#: 0cb7c5f52bc542559a35450835ce3641
msgid "3. 导出选中的代表结构"
msgstr "3. Export the selected representative structures"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/example/farthest-point-sampling.md:33
#: 9621540750ff4548a75af83796380e94
msgid "最远点采样选中的八个代表结构"
msgstr "Eight representative structures selected by FPS"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/example/farthest-point-sampling.md:33
#: 9621540750ff4548a75af83796380e94
msgid ".. image:: ../_static/image/generated/tutorials/fps_sampling_result.png"
msgstr ""
".. image:: ../_static/image/generated/tutorials/fps_sampling_result.png"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/example/farthest-point-sampling.md:38
#: bf6e873db237449b9be98c97d0bf5207
msgid ""
"运行后检查底部状态栏：本例应显示 `Sel: 8`、`Unsel: 17`。图中红色点是选中的代"
"表结构。"
msgstr ""
"After the run, check the status bar. This example should show `Sel: 8` and "
"`Unsel: 17`. The red points are the selected representative structures."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/example/farthest-point-sampling.md:40
#: 6a1e720e986a4fb19b0a712b0e12ace7
msgid ""
"确认数量后，从顶部 `Save` 菜单选择 `Export Selected` 导出。不要点击 `Delete "
"selected items`，否则删除的正是刚选出的代表结构。"
msgstr ""
"After confirming the count, choose `Export Selected` from the `Save` menu. "
"Do not click `Delete selected items`, because that would delete the "
"representative structures you just selected."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/example/farthest-point-sampling.md:42
#: 3727386cd9f0465db571ba88dec83e63
msgid ""
"`Use current selection as region` 会改变选择含义：程序只在当前选区中采样，并"
"把保留下来的代表点从选区中取消。这个选项方便随后删除选区内的冗余结构，但第一"
"次使用时建议不要勾选。"
msgstr ""
"`Use current selection as region` changes the meaning of the selection: the "
"program samples only within the current selection and then deselects the "
"representative points it keeps. This is useful when you intend to delete the "
"remaining redundant structures in that region, but leave it unchecked for "
"your first run."
